              "key": "manager_on_scene",
              "label": "Manager attended",
              "units": 1.25
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "containment_actions",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Containment actions completed",
          "items": [
            "Storage area secured and access suspended pending the audit",
            "Full count of remaining tagged items completed and compared to the log",
            "High-value safe contents verified against the safe log",
            "Cash holdings counted by two people and reconciled",
            "Access log pulled for the whole gap period",
            "Camera retention requested for the storage area and the gap period",
            "Recent release orders reviewed for a matching description",
            "Claimant informed by the responsible manager, not by storage staff"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "containment_notes",
          "type": "textarea",
          "label": "What the audit found, what remains unaccounted for, and what the claimant was told",
